From 71e77b64aaf1e92dd13815821a571b774d780ac3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiamei Xie <jiamei.xie@arm.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Oct 2023 14:56:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Introduce opaque rss driver

This external driver will forward asymmetric operations to psa service.
The psa service will transfer the requests via MHUv3 channnel to the
RSS crypto service.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Jiamei Xie <jiamei.xie@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Michael Zhao <michael.zhao@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Hongda Deng <hongda.deng@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Divin Raj <divin.raj@arm.com>
---
